# News posts — اخبار

When the user asks for a news item (`اخبار` / خبر کوهنوردی), apply **all** of the following.

## Create / publish

1. Framework: `_drafts/news-post-template.md` (never republish template prose).
2. Live file: `_news/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` with `lang: fa-IR`, `dir_attr: rtl`, unique `description`, `date`, YAML `tags`.
3. Short: what happened, why it matters. Optional link to an existing `/logbook/` report.
4. Images: `assets/news/<exact-url-slug>/` matching the news URL. Comment `image:` out until files exist.
5. Related public UI: only `اخبار مرتبط :` + flat list.
6. Hub `/news/` is chronological (newest first).
7. Homepage `/` is about + four latest teasers from each hub. The climbing-news archive is `/news/` (title: خبر کوهنوردی).
8. Visible dates on the site are Jalali via `_includes/jalali-date.html`.
9. Never invent events, dates, team members, or climb facts.
10. Never publish agent/implementation notes into live HTML. News pages have no opening «این خبر را می‌آورم» line and no مترجم/نویسنده byline.
11. International wire agent (GMT 00:00, 06:00, 12:00, 18:00): follow `.cursor/skills/news-wire/SKILL.md`. First series: last 1 hour. Later series: all unseen items since `last_run_utc`. Translate only from World Climbing, UIAA, PlanetMountain, and Climbing.com. Triple-review before publish. Skip URLs in `_data/news-wire-seen.yml`.

## Do not

- Clone a full گزارش صعود into `_news/`
- Mix news into `_logbook/`
- Keyword-stuff titles or descriptions
